OL,3,GNEWSAConcern over sudden end to rural
OL,4,Aschool's bus service
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe principal of a rural primary school
OL,7,Fhas said some parents are wondering how
OL,8,Fto get their children to school after
OL,9,Fits bus service was withdrawn just days
OL,10,Fbefore the new term started.
OL,12,FThe Education Authority (EA) said it
OL,13,Fhad replaced the bus with a taxi after
OL,14,Fit determined only six children from
OL,15,FDunseverick Primary School needed
OL,16,Fhome-to-school transport.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
