OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAConcern over sudden end to rural
OL,4,Aschool's bus service
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut principal Leanne Smyth said the
OL,7,Ffigures did not take into account
OL,8,Fchildren starting the school for the
OL,9,Fnew academic year who needed the
OL,10,Fservice - meaning the true figure was
OL,11,Fmuch higher.
OL,13,FThe EA said if demand increased, it
OL,14,Fwould "review transport options to
OL,15,Fensure arrangements continue to meet
OL,16,Fthe needs of eligible pupils".
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
